   "top": {
    "<!--StartFragment--><p class=\"1\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&sdot;</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">평면 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">일제시대 일본학생들을 위해 건설된 학교 본관으로 장방형 일자형태로 되어 있다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&sdot;</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">의장 및 양식 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">창은 오르내림창 이며</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">지붕은 목조 기와 지붕 형태로 마감이 되어 있다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p>": 1,
    "<!--StartFragment--><p class=\"1\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&sdot;</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">평면 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">당초 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">1, 2</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">층 학교 교사 </span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&sdot;</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">구조 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">: 1956</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">년에 건축된 구조는 외벽은 석재 조적조이며</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">내벽은 적벽돌 조적조에 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">1, 2</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">층바닥과 지붕구조는 목조</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">외부 석조는 전면 중앙 출입구 상부에 박공입면을 두었고</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">, 2</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">개교사를 돌출하였고</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">각 교실사이 외벽에 버팀벽</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">(buttress)</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">을 두었다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">지붕 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">슬레이트</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">슬래브</span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&sdot;</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">의장 및 장식 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">창문은 상하 인방돌을 돌출하였다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p>": 1,
    "<": 1,
    "<p><span style=\"font-family: 굴림;\">&sdot;정면에 형식에 가까운 장미창(rose window)이 있으며, 박공 부분에 종탑을 달아 전체적으로는 로마네스크풍의 성당이다.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 굴림;\">&sdot;제대가 놓이는 부분은 5각형의 평면으로 석조제대를 놓았던 흔적이 아직도 그대로 있고, 지붕은 모임지붕으로 처리했다.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 굴림;\">&sdot;바닥은 마루바닥으로 2, 3번의 교체 및 수리가 있었던 것으로 보여진다.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 굴림;\">&sdot;천장은 반원형 형태로 석회벽으로 마무리했으며, 목재 리브를 두고 있다. 상부구조는 목재 박공지붕틀에 아연 골스레트로 마감하고 있다.&nbsp;</span></p>": 1,
    "<!--StartFragment--><p class=\"1\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&sdot;</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">평면</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">장방형으로 출입구</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">하단신전</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">상단신전으로 구성되며</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">좌측으로 방들을 증축하였음</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&sdot;</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">구조</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">정면 파사드는 수직성을 강조하여 상승감을 주며 근대양식을 잘 보여주고 있음</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">함양</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">산청</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">하동의 읍민관과 유사한 형태로</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">출입구는 포치를 두고 있으며</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">출입문은 외부 철문과 내부 목재문의 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">2</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">중으로 구성되어 있음</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&sdot;</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">우측면에도 출입구를 따로 두고 있으며</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">지붕은 스레트 박공지붕임</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">홈통과 물받이가 그대로 보존되고 있으며</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">창은 세로로 긴 창을 두었음</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p>": 1,
    "<!--StartFragment--><p class=\"1\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&sdot;</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">성당은 철근콘크리트조의 고딕적 향기가 풍기는 모습을 하고 있으며 측벽</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">버트레스</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">의 높이 차이로 인해 주위의 건물들보다 성당으로서의 위계를 갖추고 있는 모습이다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&sdot;</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">강당은 과거 예배당의 역할을 일부 함께했으며</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">외형적으로는 한국의 전통을 아주 잘 계승하고 있다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">실내의 평면은 장방형의 레벨차가 없는 평탄한 모습을 하고 있으며 현재는 예배와 집회의 목적으로 활용되고 있다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&sdot;</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">사제관은 일부 증축으로 인하여 그 규모가 커졌음에도 기본적인 형태는 간직하고 있으며 입면의 구성에서 성당과 함께 고딕적인 향취가 물씬 풍겨남을 인지할 수 있다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p>": 1,
    "<!--StartFragment--><p class=\"1\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&sdot;</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">조적조 붉은벽돌 성당으로 지면으로부터 높게 건축되어 계단을 이용하여 본당으로 들어설 수 있게 되었다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">장방형의 긴평면에 종탑이 높게 설치되어 있으며</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">종탑은 로마테스크 양식이다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&sdot;</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">창은 세로로 긴 창이며</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">모두 아치창으로 구성되었고</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">아래에는 세로로 벽돌을 쌓아 하인방을 두었다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&sdot;</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">지붕은 아연조 지붕이며</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">좌</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">?</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">우측에 도머창이 각각 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">2</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">개소가 있다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p>": 1,
    "<!--StartFragment--><p class=\"1\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&sdot;</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">외벽은 화강석으로 조적하고</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">내벽은 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">RC</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">조로 벽체를 구성</span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&sdot;</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">지붕은 목재 트러스 위에 슬레이트</span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&sdot;</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">종탑을 전면 우측에 두었고</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">정면은 박공지붕을 가리는 넓고 높은 수직벽을 배경으로 주출입구의 정면을 막아서는 절곡되어진 수직벽을 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">RC</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">조로 구성하여</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">양 옆으로 출입하도록 하였다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&sdot;</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">주출입구 상부에 예수성심상을 조성</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">(1990</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">년</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">하였고</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">그 양 옆의 벽이 버트레스가 되도록 하였다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&sdot;</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">측벽은 상하 이중창으로 구성하고</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">창 없는 부분의 벽은 돌출하였다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">상부의 돌림띠</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">(cornice)</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">는 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">2</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">중으로 돌출</span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&sdot;</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">전반적으로 단순 외관을 취한 모더니즘적 구성</span></p>": 1,
    "<!--StartFragment--><p class=\"1\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">&sdot;</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">외관은 르네상스 양식과 같이 정면을 강조하기 위해 벽을 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">2</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">층 높이로 쌓고</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">중앙에 첨탑을 두었다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">첨탑에는 혹두기 돌림띠의 수평성과 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">900m&times;2100m </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">크기의 긴 원형창의 수직성을 통해 정면성을 강조하고 있다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">&sdot;</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">출입구 우측에는 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">1m</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">폭의 계단이 있으며 좌우측에는 소규모 회의실이 있다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">내부는 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">Nave</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">와 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">Aisle</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">이 일체화된 일자형을 하고 있고 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">High Altar </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">좌우측에는 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">Double</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">은 방처럼 독립적으로 구성되어 있다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p>": 1,
    "<!--StartFragment--><p class=\"1\" style=\"font-size: 9pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&sdot;</span><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">평면 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; font-size: 9pt; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">: 4</span><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">단의 계단으로 시작되는 정면 중앙 출입구를 중심으로 좌우에 사무실을 둔 동서 장방형 구조 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; font-size: 9pt; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">/ </span><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">우측 지하실은 최조실로 사용</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; font-size: 9pt; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">당시 중복도 형식으로 되어 있었으며</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; font-size: 9pt; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">현재 출입구 우측편의 사무장실 끝에 지하로 내려가는 계단이 있었던 것으로 추정됨 </span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 9pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&sdot;</span><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">구조 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; font-size: 9pt; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">마구리 쌓기와 길이 쌓기를 번갈아 놓은 적벽돌의 외벽</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; font-size: 9pt; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">영식쌓기한 벽돌조</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; font-size: 9pt; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">), </span><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">목조트러스로 구성한 우진각의 간소한 기와지붕은 일식기와 잇기의 모임지붕으로 다양한 벽체와는 달리 단순함</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; font-size: 9pt; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&sdot;</span><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">의장 및 장식 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; font-size: 9pt; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">정면은 출입구를 중심으로 양측에 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; font-size: 9pt; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">3</span><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">개씩의 창이 대칭을 이루고 있어 헌병대로서의 권위와 위엄을 강조</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; font-size: 9pt; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">출입구와 창은 상부에 아치를 두었고</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; font-size: 9pt; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">하부에는 인방을 따로 두고 있으며</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; font-size: 9pt; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">벽면은 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; font-size: 9pt; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">5</span><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">줄의 다른색 띠벽돌을 둘러 변화</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; font-size: 9pt; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">화강석 하인방과 상단 벽돌 아치의 중앙 갓돌</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; font-size: 9pt; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">(capstone, </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">冠石</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; font-size: 9pt; mso-font-width: 92%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">로 장식된 직사각형의 오르내리창</span></p>": 1
   },
